From 62a306a856c17f6f730d51656a30eba8ab93732a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 22:37:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] device/phh/treble: add custom bootanimation

Add a self-contained bootanimation/ directory with source frames
(desc.txt + part0/part1/part2 PNGs) and an Android.mk that zips them
at build time and installs the result to /system/media/bootanimation.zip,
the default path the bootanimation binary reads.

Register the module in base.mk via PRODUCT_PACKAGES so the prebuilt
actually gets installed -- the build system defines but does not
install BUILD_PREBUILT modules unless they are listed in
PRODUCT_PACKAGES.

the trebledroid dynamic-resize patch (frameworks/base 0025) scales the
animation to the device screen, so a single 448x605 source set covers
all gsi targets.
